"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e33ff380e63cd8dde8ee548ecaa5b6d515e22d706e7a2eafe8330b206fe66d7a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/eda1a0a1c85dc2cbf53e663be5c7e5586ffb90ccfcbf155f7a0fc5ef84a0771f.webp","width":256,"height":144,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐倉 綾音","creatorId":"vndb:s3892","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3892","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3892","name":"佐倉 綾音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:31426","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17288","characterName":"五更 瑠璃","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17288"},"originalCharacterName":"五更 瑠璃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"420"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"77"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"53"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"43"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kuroneko (a.k.a. Gokou Ruri) is one of the anime otaku girls Kirino had met in a gathering organized by Saori. Though their tastes in anime and games greatly differ, they nevertheless began to be good friends. She also became a good friend to Kyousuke, and it is hinted that she may have feelings for him. As befits the Kuroneko epithet, she is usually seen wearing a black Gothic Lolita-style dress, and is sharp-tongued and antisocial."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From AniDB"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17288"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9b40f22133e01e1c01bbbf8d058685aa7bb820303aa959b893b8f0f75b6fe4f2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/98e2a37d5d09332a010dc9c5dd7a95cece496c6c93777fa2a1ef893af6a057b4.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"花澤 香菜","creatorId":"vndb:s237","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s237","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s237","name":"花澤香菜","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:31416","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17289","characterName":"高坂 京介","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17289"},"originalCharacterName":"高坂 京介","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"175"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Protagonist of the game and Kirino's older brother. He is a fairly ordinary second-year high school student who wishes for nothing more than a peaceful life until he accidentally discovers his little sister Kirino's otaku hobbies. Even though Kirino is mean and disrespectful to him, he tries to be a good elder brother to her, giving her advice as best he can, and helping her to continue in her hobbies and make new friends. He is a responsible and reliable person who cares deeply about the welfare of his sister and of his friends."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From AniDB"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17289"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b32343ca8156fd391c34889b60347c92178d73c1afd7a349d552e10be7309446.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/da1a60f3d1fdead8648e9cd03889bfe42886724e7570a62549372e260a852779.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中村 悠一","creatorId":"vndb:s348","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s348","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s348","name":"中村 悠一","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:31419","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17290","characterName":"新垣 あやせ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17290"},"originalCharacterName":"新垣 あやせ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"166"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"44"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kirino and Kanako's classmate and like her, also works part-time as a fashion model. She is initially very prejudiced against otaku culture, being biased by the treatment of otakus in the media. When she discovers that Kirino has such proclivities she breaks off their friendship, but Kyousuke manages to reconcile them, and he manages to get Ayase to grudgingly accept that part of Kirino."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From AniDB"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17290"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bc54ebd56cd6f4d3c85d02c3539961bca415d9a8ad2e706ae05a941d238df87f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/13738ceaa9516c11407ac6c63a89c0c0f757f022e087199f6890b15c97e78ee9.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"早見 沙織","creatorId":"vndb:s1871","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1871","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1871","name":"早見 沙織","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:31423","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17291","characterName":"高坂 桐乃","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17291"},"originalCharacterName":"高坂 桐乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"14"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"408"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"81"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"54"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kyousuke younger sister. She is a 14-year old girl who seems normal on the outside, but is in secret a hardcore otaku obsessed with anime and visual novel eroges, especially those involving little sisters. She works part-time as a model, which is how she managed to purchase her most impressive collection of figurines, visual novels, and anime DVDs. She has a talent for writing, and loves track and field. She is initially cold and disrespectful towards her brother Kyousuke, but after he discovers her secret hobby and he supports her in it, they gradually grow closer"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From AniDB"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17291"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2cb8970246c653960e38369fa917ceaf3d7cae107f921ac7df1ac8b73fe2538b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f63d7a92957ca5e387d9505139845237979e5909a7c76c32346657caaac2121a.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"竹達 彩奈","creatorId":"vndb:s1767","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1767","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1767","name":"竹達 彩奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:31422","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17292","characterName":"槇島 沙織","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17292"},"originalCharacterName":"槇島 沙織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"180"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"61"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"61"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The leader of \"Anime Girls Unite!\" group and organized the get-together in Akihabara where she met Kirino and Kuroneko for the first time. She is the peacemaker of the group, and her friendly disposition helps to defuse tensions between Kirino and Kuroneko, keeping their arguments about each other's tastes from getting out of hand."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She tends to speak in a very quirky way, always using a very polite and antiquated mode of Japanese generally heard today only in samurai movies. Not much is known about her for certain, not even her real name (Saori Vageena is her handle on the anime board and evidently a pseudonym)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Brief scenes of her at home show her in what looks a large mansion, attended by maids and butlers, implying that she is very wealthy, although neither the Kousaka siblings nor Kuroneko seem to be aware of this."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"While she's not wearing the glasses, she's very beautiful, totally opposite with \"tomboy style\" as usual."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From AniDB and Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17292"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc9acb0b687a74d882ddc5cd051c45ee7b52f9010b03b1e0696e4d7cc8bc435a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/4968e3a732667e2437283fa3babb9180921c79dae212a6a98826aca5431de005.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"生天目 仁美","creatorId":"vndb:s270","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s270","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s270","name":"生天目仁美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:31418","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17293","characterName":"田村 麻奈実","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17293"},"originalCharacterName":"田村 麻奈実","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"504"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"50"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kyousuke's classmate and childhood friend. She lives with her younger brother and grandparents, who are proprietors of a sweets shop a short distance from the Kousaka house. She has been friends with Kyousuke since childhood, and has a rather obvious crush on him that he seems oblivious to. She is rather frumpy and plain-looking and a little clumsy, but is also very kind and good-natured."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In her end, Manami and Kyousuke have twin daughters."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from AniDB"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17293"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a76e6b60be0e9e06f0a9f588d31a144938012cf92a6fb6974dfa236d6975accd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/aef5f35da23f51b768e5ea44ccc5da45e8a0623d5d2a57572a0403fc041ee356.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐藤 聡美","creatorId":"vndb:s4838","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4838","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4838","name":"佐藤聡美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:31428","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17294","characterName":"来栖 加奈子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17294"},"originalCharacterName":"来栖 加奈子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"70"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"148"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"77"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"51"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"39"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kurusu Kanako is a friend to Kirino and Ayase, and like them also works as a model, but is also a budding idol and can sing and dance very well. Like Ayase she is also biased against otaku culture, but Ayase manages to trick her into cosplaying as the main character in Kirino's favorite anime Stardust Witch Meruru for a contest, whose prize is a limited edition Stardust Witch Meruru figurine. She manages to win the contest because of her uncanny resemblance to the main character, and her ability to sing the anime's main theme so well despite never having sung it before."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"from AniDB"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17294"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e4aeee64ef3332ab47fef0999afb3b55c60b8262a65b20cda316b817a4a72db9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/142ffd2d1a58065efe7a301db19e70c1174c599edbb4fa2158bffdbb48b45b1b.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田村 ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s104","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s104","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s104","name":"田村 ゆかり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:31415","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17295","characterName":"赤城 瀬菜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17295"},"originalCharacterName":"赤城 瀬菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"48"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kouhei's little sister and a member of the Games Research club, as well as Ruri's classmate. Similar to Kirino, she has an obsessi